# No semicolon anywhere in this file, comments included. ksud splits it on newlines and on
# semicolons, and the tail of a split comment is parsed as a rule and aborts the install.

# The ART hook engine patches code inside system_server. NeoZygisk grants the same rule, and
# it is repeated here so that this module does not depend on NeoZygisk's own policy file.
allow system_server system_server process execmem
